	(text "12 V mode boost (build option, DNP by default): XL6019E1, VOUT = 1.25V x (1 + 100k/3.16k + 100k/13.3k) - Vdac x 100k/13.3k = 26..50 V.\nA boost cannot go below MAIN_IN minus the diode drop: fit it only when MAIN_IN <= ~24 V (VIN abs max 45 V). Diode >= 60 V; tab = SW node."
