	(text "Level shifting: 3V3 buffers (5V-tolerant inputs) for DIN/CLK in, 5V AHCT buffer for DOUT out. CLK is input-only\n(daisy-chain passes CLK through J13/J14 pin 2). The 100k pull-downs keep the inputs defined when no source is connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ba39eba-323e-4ae1-a0b9-290c978b0651")
	)
	(text "Optional ESP module (WLED, ESPHome...): Wemos D1 mini generic pinout on two 1x8 sockets, stacked above the board (low parts may sit underneath).\nSPI master -> RP2040 SPI0 slave: D5 SCK -> CLK, D7 MOSI -> DIN, D6 MISO <- DOUT, D8 CS -> ESP_CS. Assumes no external data in when the ESP is fitted.\n3-pin header 5V/DATA/GND: DATA joins DIN for single-wire (WS2812) data. Powered from the main-power 5V only (not USB); flash it through its own USB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e3525cdc-2fab-4d6c-86ac-fd774e4a6615")
	)
